---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const comparisons = [
  ['Senior expertise in selling and advising', 'Senior expertise applied directly to implementation'],
  ['Requirements passed between teams', 'One operator connects judgment, architecture and execution'],
  ['Capacity grows through more staffing', 'AI and reusable systems extend the senior builder’s reach'],
  ['Implementation ends in a handoff', 'An ongoing relationship to run and improve the function'],
];
---
<Layout title="Thriai — Don't hire a consultant. Hire a builder.">
  <div class="opening" id="opening">
    <div class="system-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="system-stage">
      <div class="system-atmosphere"></div>
      <div class="system-fallback"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <canvas id="system-canvas"></canvas>
      <div class="scene-index"><span class="scene-dot"></span> <span id="scene-label">01 / CONNECT THE INFORMATION</span></div>
    </div></div>
    <section class="builder-hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Senior finance expertise.<br class="mobile-only" /> Hands-on AI implementation.</p>
      <h1 id="hero-heading"><span>Don't hire</span><span>a consultant.</span><span class="builder-line">Hire a builder<span class="orange-period">.</span></span></h1>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><p>Thriai designs, builds and runs your AI-native finance function. The senior expert who understands your business is the person implementing the systems—and stays involved in operating them.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#demo">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Talk about your business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="hero-footnote"><span>JUDGMENT → SYSTEMS → DECISIONS</span><span>SCROLL TO CONNECT <b aria-hidden="true">↓</b></span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="delivery-section wrap" aria-labelledby="delivery-heading">
      <div class="section-number">01 / THE DELIVERY MODEL</div>
      <div class="delivery-heading"><h2 id="delivery-heading">A different<br />delivery model.</h2><p>The person who sees how it should work<br />is the person who builds it.</p></div>
      <div class="comparison-table" role="table" aria-label="Comparison of delivery models">
        <div class="comparison-row comparison-head" role="row"><span role="columnheader">A traditional consulting model</span><span role="columnheader">The Thriai approach <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></span></div>
        {comparisons.map(([before,after],i)=><div class="comparison-row" role="row"><span role="cell"><small>0{i+1}</small>{before}</span><span role="cell">{after}</span></div>)}
      </div>
      <p class="comparison-note">A comparison of operating models; individual firms and engagements vary.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="reach-section wrap" aria-labelledby="reach-heading">
      <div class="section-number">02 / WHY IT WORKS</div>
      <h2 id="reach-heading">AI changes<br />what a senior<br />expert can <em>deliver.</em></h2>
      <div class="reach-copy"><p>Experienced operators know how the pieces should fit together. AI gives a hands-on expert greater reach to build the connections.</p><p>Integrations. Automated workflows. Financial models. Information connected across the business. Senior judgment stays close to the work, from the first architectural decision through everyday operation.</p><p class="reach-statement">The expertise stays human.<br />The capacity keeps expanding.</p></div>
    </section>
    <div class="light-transition" aria-hidden="true"><span>INFORMATION BECOMES A DECISION.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="light-world">
    <section class="proof-section wrap" aria-labelledby="proof-heading">
      <div class="section-number">03 / FROM OPERATING EXPERIENCE TO WORKING SYSTEMS</div>
      <div class="proof-intro"><h2 id="proof-heading">Built inside<br /><span>a real finance</span><br />function.</h2><div><p class="large-copy">The business judgment<br />and the ability to build it.</p><p>Thriai grew out of Eric Anderson’s hands-on work connecting finance, planning, revenue operations and AI at a mid-market SaaS company.</p><p>Eric combines that implementation experience with finance leadership, acquisition support and investor reporting. The person designing your finance function understands the decisions it needs to support.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Meet your builder <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="proof-disclosure">Founder operating experience, separate from Thriai client engagements.</p></div></div>
      <div class="decision-demo" id="demo">
        <div class="demo-heading"><div><span class="demo-badge"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> ILLUSTRATIVE WORKING DEMO</span><h3>Can we make<br />the next two hires?</h3></div><p>One question. Connected cash and hiring assumptions. Change an input and follow the decision through.</p></div>
        <noscript><p class="notice">The scenario below is shown at its default assumptions. Enable JavaScript to adjust the inputs and recalculate.</p></noscript>
        <div class="demo-workspace">
          <form class="demo-inputs" id="scenario-form" aria-label="Illustrative hiring scenario">
            <div class="demo-step">01 / THE INPUTS</div>
            <label for="cash">Cash today <span>USD</span><div class="input-shell"><b>$</b><input id="cash" name="cash" type="number" min="1" max="100000000" step="1" value="1200000" aria-describedby="demo-error" required /></div></label>
            <label for="burn">Monthly net cash burn <span>BEFORE HIRES</span><div class="input-shell"><b>$</b><input id="burn" name="burn" type="number" min="1" max="10000000" step="1" value="75000" aria-describedby="demo-error" required /></div></label>
            <label for="hires">Planned hires <output for="hires" id="hire-count">2 people</output><input id="hires" name="hires" type="range" min="0" max="6" step="1" value="2" /></label>
            <label for="hire-cost">Monthly cost per hire <span>FULLY LOADED</span><div class="input-shell"><b>$</b><input id="hire-cost" name="hireCost" type="number" min="1" max="100000" step="1" value="10000" aria-describedby="demo-error" required /></div></label>
            <p class="demo-error" id="demo-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
          </form>
          <div class="demo-result" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">
            <div class="demo-step">02 / CONNECT THE MODEL</div>
            <div class="runway-number"><strong id="runway">12.6</strong><span>months of runway<br />with the planned hires</span></div>
            <svg class="cash-chart" viewBox="0 0 540 180" role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-title"><title id="chart-title">Illustrative cash balance: current plan versus planned hires over 12 months.</title><defs><linearGradient id="chart-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#3761ff" stop-opacity=".17"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3761ff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M20 24H520M20 80H520M20 138H520" stroke="#d9dfe6" fill="none"/><path id="cash-area" d="M20 24L520 132L520 138H20Z" fill="url(#chart-fill)"/><path id="baseline-line" d="M20 24L520 109.5" stroke="#9ea7b5" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><path id="hiring-line" d="M20 24L520 132.3" stroke="#244df5" stroke-width="3"/><circle id="cash-endpoint" cx="520" cy="132.3" r="5" fill="#ff834a"/><text x="20" y="167">TODAY</text><text x="520" y="167">MONTH 12</text></svg>
            <div class="chart-legend"><span><i class="legend-base"></i> Before hires</span><span><i class="legend-hire"></i> With hires</span></div>
            <div class="demo-answer"><div class="demo-step">03 / SEE THE TRADEOFF</div><p id="decision-answer">Two hires add $20,000 to monthly burn and reduce runway by 3.4 months. At month 12, the model leaves $60,000 in cash.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="demo-assumptions"><summary>See the arithmetic and assumptions <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div><p id="formula">$1,200,000 ÷ ($75,000 + 2 × $10,000) = 12.6 months.</p><p>Synthetic inputs, not client data or a client result. Hires start immediately. Burn and employee costs stay constant; no revenue growth, financing, severance, hiring fees or interest. The chart covers 12 months and stops at zero. A real decision also needs timing, revenue scenarios and an agreed minimum cash buffer. This is an arithmetic demonstration, not an AI-generated recommendation.</p></div></details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits-section wrap" aria-labelledby="benefits-heading">
      <div class="section-number">04 / WHAT IT MAKES POSSIBLE</div>
      <h2 id="benefits-heading">Build the foundation once.<br /><span>Keep expanding</span><br />what it can do.</h2>
      <div class="benefits-editorial">
      <figure class="decision-trail">
        <figcaption>FROM INFORMATION TO A USEFUL DECISION</figcaption>
        <div class="trail-sources"><span>Cash</span><span>People</span><span>Costs</span></div>
        <svg class="trail-connections" viewBox="0 0 400 190" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="trail-light" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="190"><stop stop-color="#719aff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ffac74"/></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="url(#trail-light)" stroke-width="3"><path d="M45 0V51Q45 80 74 80H171Q200 80 200 109V190"/><path d="M200 0V190"/><path d="M355 0V51Q355 80 326 80H229Q200 80 200 109V190"/></g><g fill="#c0d4ff"><rect x="37" y="0" width="16" height="16"/><rect x="192" y="0" width="16" height="16"/><rect x="347" y="0" width="16" height="16"/></g><path d="M200 120L229 149L200 178L171 149Z" fill="#ffae75"/><path d="M200 137L212 149L200 161L188 149Z" fill="#162d67"/></svg>
        <div class="trail-model">ONE CONNECTED MODEL</div>
        <blockquote>What can we<br />commit to?</blockquote>
        <p>Explore cash, hiring and timing together. Bring the assumptions into the conversation.</p>
        <a href="#demo" class="text-link">Try the illustrative model <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
      </figure>
      <div class="benefit-rows"><article><span>01</span><h3>Preserve<br />runway.</h3><p>Automate recurring work, consolidate overlapping tools and reduce dependence on disconnected service providers. Put more of your budget toward building the business.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Get answers while<br />decisions are still open.</h3><p>Bring financial and operating information together. Explore performance, cash and hiring with AI grounded in your company’s data, supported by an experienced finance operator.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Be ready when the<br />questions get harder.</h3><p>Give your board, investors and external reviewers consistent reporting and a clear path to the underlying records. Carry that foundation into fundraising, diligence and your next stage.</p></article></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="scope-section" id="services" aria-labelledby="scope-heading"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-number">05 / A CONNECTED FINANCE FUNCTION</div>
      <div class="scope-heading"><h2 id="scope-heading">Each part makes<br />the others<br /><em>more useful.</em></h2><p>The information that runs your books should inform your forecast, support a board discussion and help answer an investor’s question. We bring bookkeeping, cash operations, planning, reporting and systems into one operating approach.</p></div>
      <figure class="scope-map">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="scope-map-title">
          <title id="scope-map-title">Books, revenue and people connect in one finance model to support planning, reporting and decisions.</title>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#8096b8" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M85 70V108Q85 138 115 138H485Q515 138 515 108V70M300 70V138M300 186V206Q300 236 270 236H115Q85 236 85 262M300 186V262M300 236H485Q515 236 515 262"/></g>
          <g class="map-source"><text x="85" y="45">Books</text><text x="300" y="45">Revenue</text><text x="515" y="45">People</text></g>
          <g fill="#315bff"><circle cx="85" cy="70" r="4"/><circle cx="300" cy="70" r="4"/><circle cx="515" cy="70" r="4"/></g>
          <rect x="154" y="130" width="292" height="61" rx="30" fill="#14284d"/>
          <text class="map-core" x="300" y="169">One finance model</text>
          <g class="map-output"><text x="85" y="292">Plan</text><text x="300" y="292">Report</text><text x="515" y="292">Decide</text></g>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>The same information, working across the function.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="practice-list"><a href="/pricing"><span>01</span><div><h3>Fractional CFO</h3><p>The judgment. Financial leadership, planning and an ongoing operating relationship.</p></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/pricing"><span>02</span><div><h3>AI Finance Platform</h3><p>The foundation. Connected information, automated workflows and useful AI access.</p></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/pricing"><span>03</span><div><h3>Revenue Systems</h3><p>The connections. Revenue operations and financial data that work together.</p></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/pricing">Explore scopes and published pricing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div></section>
    <section class="engagement-section wrap" aria-labelledby="engagement-heading"><div class="section-number">06 / AN ONGOING RELATIONSHIP</div><h2 id="engagement-heading">Build. Run.<br /><span>Keep improving.</span></h2><div class="engagement-grid">
      <figure class="operating-cycle">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 520 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="cycle-title"><title id="cycle-title">An ongoing operating loop: build the systems, run the function, improve it as the business evolves. Senior judgment stays involved throughout.</title><defs><linearGradient id="cycle-blue" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#183671"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#3768ff"/></linearGradient></defs>
          <path d="M239 47C112 47 37 160 61 275" fill="none" stroke="#d7e0f0" stroke-width="42"/>
          <path d="M75 305C143 416 294 447 393 365" fill="none" stroke="#a8bff0" stroke-width="42"/>
          <path d="M416 336C496 215 439 62 304 49" fill="none" stroke="url(#cycle-blue)" stroke-width="42"/>
          <path d="M45 268L61 299L85 272Z" fill="#d7e0f0"/><path d="M374 349L411 349L396 380Z" fill="#a8bff0"/><path d="M310 28L275 45L310 69Z" fill="#1c3c83"/>
          <circle cx="262" cy="225" r="80" fill="#11284f"/><path d="M262 190V260M227 225H297M237 200L287 250M237 250L287 200" stroke="#ffb17b" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="328" y="158" width="148" height="44" rx="22" fill="#f4f5f3"/><g class="cycle-words"><text x="98" y="162">BUILD</text><text x="250" y="377">RUN</text><text x="401" y="186">IMPROVE</text></g>
          <circle class="cycle-marker" cx="422" cy="118" r="9" fill="#ff995e" stroke="#f4f5f3" stroke-width="4"/>
        </svg>
        <figcaption>Senior judgment stays in the loop.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div><p class="large-copy">A stronger foundation.<br />An operator who stays.</p><p>We understand the business, take ownership of the agreed finance responsibilities and build the systems that support them. Then we operate the function and keep improving it as your needs and AI capabilities evolve.</p><p>Whether you are establishing finance for the first time or giving an existing team a stronger foundation, the relationship starts with where you want the business to go.</p><div class="engagement-terms"><span>Defined scope</span><span>Published pricing</span><span>Your systems</span></div></div></div></section>
  </div>
  <section class="closing-section"><div class="closing-beam" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap"><span class="section-number">THE NEXT STAGE STARTS HERE</span><h2>Build the finance<br />function your<br /><span>next stage needs.</span></h2><div class="closing-bottom"><p>Tell us where the business is today<br />and what you want it to become.</p><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Talk about your business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <script>import '../scripts/home';</script>
</Layout>
